window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Love can conquer many things.</b></p> <p>Sacrifice even more.</p> <p>Which is why I jumped into Hell and found myself in the very last place I ever imagined. A place of discovery. A place where knowledge is key, and truth is power.</p> <p>So, as the secrets start unravelling and past lives begin catching up with me, I am given a choice: To stay hidden and save everyone I love, or throw Fate a curveball and fight for the chance at happiness.</p> <p>But even I know that love won't win this war alone. And the war for Hell's new throne has just begun.</p> <p>As old foes rise and new dangers emerge, the fight for survival will demand everything.</p> <p>Loyalties will be tested. Blood will be spilled. And in the end, the HellBeast King must make an impossible choice. One that could change the Underworld forever.</p> <p>Where the past meets the present, and the future of Hell hangs in the balance, as now it is time for…</p> <p><i>The HellBeast's Battle.</i></p> <p>Where fate is brutal, the stakes are deadly, and the final reckoning is coming.</p>"; 
